00:28:50.041 --> 00:28:52.290
"Tidak, tidak. Tak apa, tak masalah."

00:28:52.291 --> 00:28:56.898
Lalu dia mulai memotong
kulit rotinya sendiri.

00:28:56.899 --> 00:28:59.440
Taft. Hei, Taft,
kau masih bersamaku?

00:28:59.442 --> 00:29:00.165
Ya, saya di sini.

00:29:00.166 --> 00:29:04.290
Perdana Menteri Prancis
tak suka kulit roti.

00:29:04.291 --> 00:29:05.666
Tak suka kulit roti, benar.

00:29:06.569 --> 00:29:08.778
Kau tahu menurutku kenapa?

00:29:08.796 --> 00:29:09.374
Kenapa?

00:29:09.375 --> 00:29:11.855
Kurasa itu semacam nostalgia

00:29:11.856 --> 00:29:14.077
