00:31:21.875 --> 00:31:25.036
Astaga. Pak...

00:31:25.038 --> 00:31:26.207
Dia bajingan yang nekat.

00:31:26.208 --> 00:31:29.332
Terlalu berani sampai kebablasan.

00:31:29.333 --> 00:31:31.540
Dia melompat ke depan senapan Browning
demi menyelamatkanku.

00:31:31.541 --> 00:31:32.999
Sial.

00:31:33.000 --> 00:31:36.499
Tiga peluru kaliber .50.

00:31:36.500 --> 00:31:39.175
Satu tembus, dua di perut.

00:31:39.176 --> 00:31:40.009
Astaga.

00:31:40.011 --> 00:31:44.000
Ya, anak itu terus berdarah.
Dia mengalami pendarahan hebat.

00:31:45.833 --> 00:31:48.457
Kami terjebak di neraka. Hanya kami.

00:31:48.458 --> 00:31:50.540
Tanpa perbekalan, tanpa apa pun.

00:31:50.541 --> 00:31:54.665
Hanya aku, Diaz, Eric, Jeffries,

00:31:54.666 --> 00:31:57.416
