00:32:56.458 --> 00:32:58.666
Ya, itu kata kunci
semua gawaiku.

00:33:01.809 --> 00:33:03.414
<i>Motherfucker</i>. Bagaimana...?

00:33:03.416 --> 00:33:06.124
<i>Motherfucker</i>. Kalau saya
yang bilang, rasanya beda.

00:33:06.125 --> 00:33:07.501
Kau harus ucapkan begini...

00:33:07.503 --> 00:33:09.832
