Seperti stapler bedah.

00:34:45.458 --> 00:34:47.957
Bagus. Ya, pakai itu.

00:34:47.958 --> 00:34:49.820
Tarik napas. Beberapa kali.

00:34:49.848 --> 00:34:50.707
- Baik.
- Siap?

00:34:50.708 --> 00:34:51.705
Tarik napas dalam.

00:34:51.707 --> 00:34:53.248
Tarik napas dalam lagi.

00:34:53.249 --> 00:34:55.476
Ayo. Bernapas.

00:35:01.708 --> 00:35:03.187
Jangan terburu-buru.

00:35:09.250 --> 00:35:13.460
Sial.

00:35:13.504 --> 00:35:15.851
Sialan.

00:35:16.625 --> 00:35:20.901
Bangsat, keparat, anak haram!

00:35:20.902 --> 00:35:24.207
Taft, kau lihat laci di belakang itu?

00:35:24.291 --> 00:35:27.165
Simpanan pribadi Presiden?

00:35:27.166 --> 00:35:30.125
Ya, isinya barang bagus.

00:35:31.333 --> 00:35:33.249
Ini ide buruk.

00:35:33.250 --> 00:35:34.832
Ambil apa saja.

00:35:34.833 --> 00:35:36.540
Tapi jangan ambil Verona.

00:35:36.541 --> 00:35:37.957
Itu milikku dan Rosa.

00:35:37.958 --> 00:35:40.665
Itu minuman istimewa kami
untuk momen istimewa,

00:35:40.666 --> 00:35:43.082
