silakan saja nikmati.

00:35:43.083 --> 00:35:44.166
Baik.

00:35:54.250 --> 00:35:56.128
Astaga, Nak.

00:35:56.250 --> 00:35:59.899
Ayolah, itu 150 dolar seteguk.

00:35:59.909 --> 00:36:00.957
Ya, ini barang bagus.

00:36:00.958 --> 00:36:04.207
Kau baru menenggak
sekitar 250 dolar tadi.

00:36:04.208 --> 00:36:07.166
Saya rasa tadi sekitar 600, 700 dolar.

00:36:09.386 --> 00:36:11.915
Pak, Anda mau?

00:36:11.916 --> 00:36:12.875
Aku menyetir, Taft.

00:36:12.915 --> 00:36:15.082
Oh, maaf, Pak. Tentu saja.

00:36:15.083 --> 00:36:15.768
Tidak, aku cuma bercanda.

00:36:15.770 --> 00:36:18.716
Berikan aku seteguk.

00:36:23.875 --> 00:36:25.332
Ini barang bagus.

00:36:25.333 --> 00:36:26.225
<i>Permisi, Pak.</i>

00:36:26.226 --> 00:36:29.124
<i>Pak, Anda memasuki</i>
