<i>agar mereka bisa menyisir</i>
<i>gang di kanan Anda.</i>

00:36:34.250 --> 00:36:35.540
<i>Tunggu sinyal hijau mereka.</i>

00:36:35.541 --> 00:36:37.194
Ya, diterima.

00:37:00.750 --> 00:37:02.249
Hei, pelan-pelan, Nak.

00:37:02.250 --> 00:37:03.480
Aku tak mau kau pingsan.

00:37:03.482 --> 00:37:05.016
Ini membantu, Pak.

00:37:07.083 --> 00:37:08.666
Masih terus menekan?

00:37:09.666 --> 00:37:10.750
Siap, Pak.

00:37:22.875 --> 00:37:24.041
Seberapa parah, Pak?

00:37:25.000 --> 00:37:25.957
Apa?

00:37:25.958 --> 00:37:27.166
Medan neraka itu.

00:37:29.625 --> 00:37:32.750
Kurasa saya mulai sedikit mabuk.

00:37:32.752 --> 00:37:34.374
Jelas saja.

00:37:34.375 --> 00:37:36.090
<i>Mohon bersiaga, Pak.</i>

00:37:38.041 --> 00:37:39.208
Parah.

00:37:40.250 --> 00:37:41.207
Pak.

00:37:41.208 --> 00:37:43.916
Vietnam. Sungguh parah.

00:37:44.875 --> 00:37:49.148
Tiga hari itu, Jeffries
kehabisan darah, sekarat,

00:37:52.625 --> 00:37:53.875
